    "type": "section",
    "text": {
      "type": "mrkdwn",
      "text": "🔴 api in shop was killed for using more memory than its 256Mi limit. Confirmed.\n• Last exit: OOMKilled, exit code 137, 4 restarts in 40 minutes.\n• The limit is 256Mi and the request is 128Mi.\n\nRaise the memory limit to 384Mi, half again above the observed peak of 255Mi (changes the cluster):\n```\nkubectl set resources deployment/payments -n shop -c app --limits=memory=384Mi\n```",
      "verbatim": true
    }
  },
  {
